WEBVTT

01:44.840 --> 01:45.680
Yao'er.

01:48.920 --> 01:50.080
My dear Yao'er.

01:50.680 --> 01:51.520
Dear.

01:55.320 --> 01:57.080
What happened to Yao'er?

01:57.160 --> 01:58.920
Take a look at these rashes.

01:59.000 --> 02:00.040
She has rashes all over.

02:02.160 --> 02:05.400
Did any of you have sandalwood
with you just now?

02:05.480 --> 02:08.520
Since she was a kid, Ms. Ruoyao
can't get into contact with sandalwood.

02:08.600 --> 02:10.800
Everyone in the Jiang Residence
knows this.

02:10.880 --> 02:12.560
Naturally, they wouldn't have it on them.

02:13.040 --> 02:14.280
Could it be the guest

02:14.800 --> 02:16.120
who carried it?

02:24.240 --> 02:25.560
Speak up if you have something to say.

02:28.040 --> 02:28.880
Her ladyship

02:30.040 --> 02:33.200
started developing rashes
after wearing earrings from Ms. Jiang Li.

02:33.280 --> 02:35.240
Could it be in the earrings?

02:38.760 --> 02:40.280
Take off the earrings and check them.

02:40.360 --> 02:41.480
Yes.

02:57.160 --> 02:58.000
Ms. Jiang Li.

02:58.080 --> 02:59.360
Why did you do this?

02:59.440 --> 03:01.240
I know you're displeased

03:01.320 --> 03:02.760
and are not fond of Ms. Ruoyao.

03:03.360 --> 03:05.040
But such an act is simply out of line.

03:06.000 --> 03:07.280
I don't dislike Ruoyao at all

03:08.600 --> 03:10.120
nor did I add any fragrance.

03:10.680 --> 03:11.960
All the evidence points to you.

03:12.040 --> 03:13.400
How can you deny it?

03:14.360 --> 03:15.280
Li'er,

03:17.000 --> 03:18.240
explain yourself.

03:20.840 --> 03:21.680
Father,

03:22.760 --> 03:23.760
can you give me

03:23.840 --> 03:25.560
some time alone with Ruoyao?

03:26.200 --> 03:27.240
What are you up to?

03:27.720 --> 03:29.360
I experienced similar symptoms

03:29.920 --> 03:31.440
when I was at Zhennv Hall.

03:32.280 --> 03:33.600
I know a way

03:33.680 --> 03:35.200
to make Ruoyao feel better.

03:35.280 --> 03:37.520
Why can't your father and I see it?

03:39.080 --> 03:40.000
Mother,

03:40.080 --> 03:40.960
please trust me.

03:42.640 --> 03:43.920
With you and Father here,

03:45.080 --> 03:46.080
what are you afraid of?

04:08.920 --> 04:09.760
They're all gone.

04:09.840 --> 04:11.200
Just say what you want.

04:11.280 --> 04:12.280
Why did you do this to me?

04:12.360 --> 04:13.360
Ruoyao,

04:14.200 --> 04:16.000
I didn't mean to steal your thunder today.

04:16.680 --> 04:18.000
As your older sister, I only want

04:18.079 --> 04:20.440
to extend my congratulations
like any sister would do today.

04:20.519 --> 04:21.560
However,

04:23.480 --> 04:26.280
someone deliberately stopped me
from attending your Hairpin Ceremony.

04:28.880 --> 04:30.840
Stop feigning innocence.

04:30.920 --> 04:31.800
Tell me.

04:31.880 --> 04:33.400
Why did you use sandalwood to harm me?

04:33.960 --> 04:35.920
You clearly know
you're allergic to sandalwood.

04:36.760 --> 04:38.960
Yet you endured this pain out for a ploy

04:39.040 --> 04:40.880
to vent your anger
from the Hairpin Ceremony.

04:40.960 --> 04:42.200
It must really be hard on you.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.600
Then we have nothing to discuss further.

04:44.680 --> 04:45.680
Let Father come in

04:46.520 --> 04:48.280
so he can see your vicious true colors.

04:48.840 --> 04:50.560
I asked them to leave

04:50.640 --> 04:52.160
to preserve your dignity.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.680
Do you think the ploy

04:53.760 --> 04:54.960
of harming yourself

04:55.040 --> 04:56.080
would make them punish me?

04:57.160 --> 04:58.040
What do you mean?

04:58.120 --> 05:00.120
If you're certain that I'm behind this,

05:01.000 --> 05:03.040
let me deduce what will happen next.

05:04.120 --> 05:04.960
First of all,

05:05.480 --> 05:06.880
I'll ask my maid,

05:06.960 --> 05:08.600
Xiangqiao, to testify for me.

05:09.640 --> 05:11.440
After I bought these earrings,

05:11.520 --> 05:13.240
they've been under her safekeeping.

05:13.320 --> 05:14.560
I've never touched them since.

05:15.080 --> 05:15.920
I know.

05:16.440 --> 05:18.200
Xiangqiao works for you and your mother.

05:19.000 --> 05:21.720
So she'll go to great lengths to frame me.

05:21.800 --> 05:23.960
It was Ms. Jiang Li
who put the fragrance in there.

05:24.040 --> 05:25.000
I saw it myself.

05:25.080 --> 05:26.800
Nonsense.
You're making slanderous accusations.

05:26.880 --> 05:27.760
Xiangqiao,

05:27.840 --> 05:29.440
you must have lost your conscience

05:29.520 --> 05:31.040
to make up such a baseless accusation.

05:31.120 --> 05:32.480
No, I'm not!

05:33.560 --> 05:34.880
If I'm lying,

05:35.480 --> 05:37.000
heaven shall strike me with lightning!

05:39.000 --> 05:39.840
Then

05:40.360 --> 05:42.440
Mother will take the opportunity
to aggravate the situation.

05:42.520 --> 05:43.360
Li'er,

05:43.440 --> 05:46.000
you could've come to me directly
if you're displeased.

05:46.080 --> 05:47.520
Ruoyao is your younger sister.

05:47.600 --> 05:49.960
How could you not consider family ties?

05:50.520 --> 05:51.960
Isn't this the truth?

05:52.040 --> 05:53.040
Of course not.

05:53.120 --> 05:55.120
Because the earrings containing
the fragrance

05:56.000 --> 05:56.920
is an imitation.

05:58.000 --> 05:58.840
What?

05:58.920 --> 06:01.680
A few days ago, I spent 20 taels of silver

06:01.760 --> 06:03.960
on these earrings
at the capital's Jixiang Store.

06:04.040 --> 06:06.160
Earrings of this quality and price

06:06.240 --> 06:07.720
are rarely seen in the entire store.

06:07.800 --> 06:10.680
But the craftsmanship
of these earrings is rough.

06:10.760 --> 06:11.880
Forget about 20 taels.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.000
They're not even worth one tael.

06:14.080 --> 06:15.720
Grandmother is knowledgeable about these.

06:15.800 --> 06:16.880
She'd notice at a glance.

06:24.240 --> 06:25.720
Jixiang Store products

06:26.240 --> 06:28.600
cannot possibly be of this quality.

06:28.680 --> 06:29.840
So here comes the question.

06:31.000 --> 06:34.560
Who swapped the earrings
that I intended to give you?

06:34.640 --> 06:36.200
You don't have to frame Xiangqiao.

06:36.280 --> 06:37.280
She's not that bold.

06:38.320 --> 06:39.960
A person's boldness is nurtured.

06:40.440 --> 06:41.640
During this time,

06:41.720 --> 06:43.360
I've always given Xiangqiao nice things.

06:44.120 --> 06:45.400
Nice things

06:45.480 --> 06:47.160
naturally breed courage.

06:47.240 --> 06:49.720
She thought
I would be kicked out sooner or later.

06:49.800 --> 06:52.760
This expensive pair of earrings
will eventually end up with Mother,

06:53.560 --> 06:55.000
so it's better to keep them herself.

06:55.080 --> 06:56.960
Do you really think
people are that foolish?

06:57.440 --> 06:59.320
Who would believe your story?

06:59.880 --> 07:00.720
Coincidentally,

07:01.280 --> 07:02.120
I have a witness.

07:02.200 --> 07:03.520
I wasn't sure

07:03.600 --> 07:04.960
Xiangqiao would switch them out,

07:05.040 --> 07:07.080
so I had Tong'er follow her.

07:07.640 --> 07:09.960
She indeed went to the craftsman
specializing in counterfeits.

07:10.440 --> 07:12.800
Everything will fall into place
after Father's probing.

07:12.880 --> 07:13.760
So what?

07:14.360 --> 07:15.760
How can you prove

07:15.840 --> 07:18.200
that a greedy maid
was the one who put the fragrance?

07:18.280 --> 07:19.440
Of course there's evidence.

07:19.520 --> 07:21.680
The fragrance is in Xiangqiao's room.

07:21.760 --> 07:22.760
If you don't believe it,

07:23.320 --> 07:25.600
I'll ask Father to investigate now.

07:25.680 --> 07:26.560
How is that possible?

07:26.640 --> 07:28.160
It's not that Xiangqiao is incompetent.

07:28.640 --> 07:30.080
It's just that inequality

07:31.240 --> 07:33.600
rather than want is
the cause of trouble for most people.

07:33.680 --> 07:35.440
Yunshuang has long been jealous of her.

07:36.920 --> 07:37.800
This is from Madam Ji.

07:39.040 --> 07:39.880
All right.

07:41.440 --> 07:43.000
This is my last warning.

07:43.080 --> 07:44.240
Don't ruin Madam Ji's plan.

07:44.800 --> 07:47.360
If you still remember
that I brought you to work here,

07:47.440 --> 07:48.680
don't stir up trouble.

07:49.320 --> 07:50.880
So what if you brought me to work here?

07:51.480 --> 07:53.160
Why must you always mention it?

07:53.240 --> 07:54.600
Let's rely on our own abilities.

07:57.400 --> 08:00.080
You can't blame others
if you're not doing well.

08:14.840 --> 08:16.560
If this scheme to frame me succeeds,

08:17.120 --> 08:19.120
it will be Xiangqiao's credit.

08:19.200 --> 08:20.200
If it fails,

08:20.760 --> 08:23.720
don't you think Yunshuang would use
this opportunity to get rid of Xiangqiao?

08:23.800 --> 08:25.400
So you've been instigating the two maids

08:25.480 --> 08:27.120
from the beginning.

08:27.600 --> 08:28.920
I'm just protecting myself.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.120
If I'm not careful,

08:30.680 --> 08:32.600
won't they add deceiving mother
and harming sister

08:33.080 --> 08:35.600
to my crimes of matricide and fratricide?

08:36.919 --> 08:38.000
It has been so long.

08:38.640 --> 08:40.120
What exactly is Li'er doing?

08:43.240 --> 08:44.840
Let them talk a bit longer.

08:45.560 --> 08:47.360
Both of them are all grown up.

08:47.440 --> 08:48.840
What can happen?

08:51.720 --> 08:53.480
Since you've figured everything out,

08:53.560 --> 08:55.000
why are you talking to me alone?

08:55.080 --> 08:56.920
Why didn't you say it

08:57.000 --> 08:58.400
in front of everyone earlier?

08:58.480 --> 09:00.240
I don't want to be your enemy.

09:00.840 --> 09:02.560
But don't think
about driving me away either.

09:02.640 --> 09:05.040
I returned to reclaim what was mine.

09:06.040 --> 09:07.200
If you keep getting in my way,

09:07.280 --> 09:08.480
I won't let it go again.

09:08.560 --> 09:09.880
That's all I have to say.

09:10.360 --> 09:12.280
Whether to pin the blame

09:12.360 --> 09:13.280
on me or not,

09:14.240 --> 09:15.120
that's up to you.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.760
Li'er grew up in Zhennv Hall.

09:18.840 --> 09:20.720
We don't know her temperament well.

09:21.280 --> 09:22.880
Her intentions may be good,

09:22.960 --> 09:25.840
but she might not handle
this matter properly.

09:25.920 --> 09:27.520
We can't help but worry

09:28.080 --> 09:29.680
when we're out here.

09:35.600 --> 09:36.640
Father,

09:37.800 --> 09:39.160
Ruoyao is much better now.

09:58.800 --> 09:59.640
Yao'er,

10:00.480 --> 10:01.520
how are you feeling now?

10:02.120 --> 10:03.000
Much better,

10:03.480 --> 10:04.520
thanks to Jiang Li.

10:05.560 --> 10:08.200
We misunderstood Jiang Li
regarding the earrings.

10:12.520 --> 10:13.360
Yao'er,

10:14.040 --> 10:14.880
tell me.

10:14.960 --> 10:16.480
What's the misunderstanding?

10:16.560 --> 10:19.240
I'm feeling a bit tired now.
I want to sleep for a while.

10:20.040 --> 10:21.560
Since it was a misunderstanding,

10:21.640 --> 10:22.840
it's good that it's resolved.

10:23.880 --> 10:24.720
Dear,

10:25.640 --> 10:27.440
don't worry too much.

10:30.120 --> 10:30.960
Yao'er,

10:31.760 --> 10:33.080
get some rest.

10:34.520 --> 10:35.480
Let's all go back now.

10:40.280 --> 10:41.200
Mother,

10:41.680 --> 10:42.680
give me the antidote.

10:42.760 --> 10:44.240
What did she say to you?

10:44.320 --> 10:45.560
Mother,

10:45.640 --> 10:48.040
your idea of making me
break out in a rash wasn't good at all.

10:48.520 --> 10:50.160
The maids you sent over

10:50.240 --> 10:51.920
can't do anything right.

10:57.600 --> 11:00.720
The matter was resolved just like that?

11:00.800 --> 11:01.640
Yes.

11:01.720 --> 11:03.480
I heard it was all a misunderstanding.

11:05.680 --> 11:07.240
Bring Li'er here.

11:07.320 --> 11:08.160
Yes.

11:16.080 --> 11:17.440
Greetings, Grandmother.

11:18.400 --> 11:20.360
I made pear soup

11:20.440 --> 11:21.680
and thought of you.

11:22.960 --> 11:23.880
Thank you, Grandmother.

11:24.360 --> 11:25.200
Come.

11:25.280 --> 11:26.240
Sit here and drink it.

11:35.800 --> 11:37.680
I heard Ruoyao was sick today.

11:38.280 --> 11:40.360
And her mother
summoned you for questioning.

11:40.440 --> 11:41.840
What happened?

11:42.440 --> 11:43.960
It was nothing serious.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.640
Ruoyao just wasn't feeling well.

11:58.840 --> 12:02.240
Some people are spreading rumors
that you harbored ill intentions

12:03.120 --> 12:05.480
and the gift you gave
became something poisonous.

12:06.120 --> 12:07.760
I'm not blind, you know.

12:08.600 --> 12:10.120
You can tell me the truth.

12:10.720 --> 12:12.440
It was my maid

12:13.080 --> 12:14.600
who made a mistake.

12:14.680 --> 12:16.880
She mixed up the gift
I wanted to give Ruoyao.

12:17.720 --> 12:19.080
Mother will surely punish them.

12:20.640 --> 12:22.320
You're truly a sensible girl.

12:23.120 --> 12:26.680
It's heartbreaking
to see you suffer such grievances.

12:27.720 --> 12:29.440
After drinking the pear soup today,

12:30.240 --> 12:31.840
I no longer feel wronged.

12:36.520 --> 12:40.200
I remember that your mother chose

12:40.280 --> 12:42.280
those two maids in your courtyard.

12:45.080 --> 12:45.920
Ms. Zhang.

12:48.960 --> 12:51.800
- Accompany Li'er to Fangfei Courtyard.
- Yes.

12:52.680 --> 12:53.520
Grandmother.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.040
This is my idea.

12:55.640 --> 12:57.040
Just do as I say.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.000
That woman is not here.

13:00.080 --> 13:01.400
So this place is ours.

13:01.480 --> 13:02.520
We can…

13:02.600 --> 13:03.920
- Do what we want.
- Do what we want.

13:06.640 --> 13:07.480
Zhang, Wang.

13:07.560 --> 13:08.400
Li and Zhao.

13:08.480 --> 13:09.600
- Why are you here?
- What brings you here?

13:09.680 --> 13:10.840
- We're here to get you.
- We're here to take you.

13:10.920 --> 13:12.040
- Get them!
- Go!

13:12.120 --> 13:13.160
What are they doing?

13:13.720 --> 13:14.760
They want to take us away?

13:14.840 --> 13:15.880
- Don't touch me.
- Stop.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.200
- Stop it.
- You're hurting me.

13:17.280 --> 13:18.880
Let go!

13:18.960 --> 13:20.680
- Cut it out!
- Let go.

13:21.280 --> 13:23.720
Drag these two troublemakers out

13:23.800 --> 13:24.880
and punish them.

13:26.680 --> 13:27.760
- Ms. Zhang.
- Ms. Zhang.

13:27.840 --> 13:28.720
Is there a mistake?

13:28.800 --> 13:30.600
- Ms. Zhang, we're innocent.
- That's right.

13:30.680 --> 13:31.520
Take them away.

13:32.320 --> 13:33.760
Ms. Zhang.

13:34.520 --> 13:35.440
- Zhang, Wang.
- Li, Zhao.

13:35.520 --> 13:37.720
- We're innocent.
- We're innocent.

13:37.800 --> 13:39.720
Xiangqiao, this is all your fault.

13:39.800 --> 13:40.640
How is it my fault?

13:41.560 --> 13:43.680
- Come on.
- I'm not going. Let go.

13:43.760 --> 13:44.720
- No!
- I don't want to!

13:44.800 --> 13:46.840
No, I'm not going!

13:46.920 --> 13:47.800
I'm innocent!

13:47.880 --> 13:50.240
Ms. Jiang Li, we're wrongfully accused!

13:50.320 --> 13:51.440
I'm not going.

13:51.520 --> 13:53.480
Ms. Jiang Li, we're innocent!

13:53.560 --> 13:54.640
We're wrongfully accused!

13:57.080 --> 13:58.800
Ms. Jiang Li, you must be in shock.

13:58.880 --> 14:00.840
Old Madam already gave instructions

14:00.920 --> 14:03.080
to send you new maids tomorrow.

14:03.160 --> 14:05.320
You can keep the ones
you're satisfied with.

14:05.880 --> 14:06.920
I'm grateful to Grandmother

14:07.640 --> 14:09.720
and thank you too, Ms. Zhang, for coming.

14:09.800 --> 14:11.320
Would you like to come in for tea?

14:11.400 --> 14:13.280
I still need to report back.

14:13.360 --> 14:15.880
- Ms. Jiang Li, please rest well.
- All right.

14:19.160 --> 14:20.120
Jiang Li.

14:25.800 --> 14:27.320
You won this fight beautifully.

14:27.400 --> 14:29.000
Grandmother never gets involved

14:29.080 --> 14:30.160
in household affairs.

14:30.240 --> 14:31.680
This time, she stepped in

14:32.240 --> 14:34.040
and even took care of everything for you.

14:34.120 --> 14:35.160
What did you do?

14:35.240 --> 14:37.000
It's because Grandmother has a kind heart.

14:37.080 --> 14:38.960
Grandmother is very perceptive, you know?

14:39.040 --> 14:41.920
Even if she saw
through Aunt Shuran's schemes,

14:42.000 --> 14:43.200
she wouldn't say anything.

14:43.280 --> 14:44.800
This time, Ms. Zhang came over

14:44.880 --> 14:46.400
and took care of everything for you.

14:46.920 --> 14:49.600
You can rest easy now

14:49.680 --> 14:50.680
and won't be harmed

14:50.760 --> 14:52.480
by those lame tricks anymore.

14:53.040 --> 14:54.760
I must thank you,

14:54.840 --> 14:56.000
my good cousin.

14:59.120 --> 15:00.000
It's Jingrui

15:00.800 --> 15:02.360
or just Little Ruirui is fine.

15:05.160 --> 15:06.880
After all, gifts blind the eyes.

15:07.440 --> 15:10.120
And I really like
the little turtle you gave me.

15:11.240 --> 15:13.800
By the way, I heard
your chrysanthemum tea is especially good.

15:13.880 --> 15:15.040
Let me try some.

15:15.120 --> 15:15.960
Come on.

15:17.480 --> 15:18.520
Old Madam,

15:18.600 --> 15:20.600
we've dealt with those two maids.

15:20.680 --> 15:23.040
Tomorrow, help pick someone reliable

15:23.520 --> 15:24.840
to send over.

15:25.640 --> 15:26.480
Yes.

15:29.720 --> 15:32.040
She has been managing the household
for so many years.

15:32.120 --> 15:33.760
Why can't she let things go?

15:34.560 --> 15:36.960
Li'er came back with nothing

15:37.040 --> 15:38.760
and suffered so much in the mountain.

15:38.840 --> 15:40.880
What harm is there in being nicer to her?

15:42.720 --> 15:44.560
Yuanbai adores her so much.

15:45.960 --> 15:47.160
We're both women.

15:47.920 --> 15:49.160
And I can't say

15:49.640 --> 15:51.360
that Yuanbai is wrong.

15:51.440 --> 15:53.360
Madam Ji is a smart person.

15:53.440 --> 15:55.880
I'm sure she'll behave in the future.

15:56.760 --> 15:58.360
Let's hope your words come true.

16:01.640 --> 16:04.320
Why did Old Madam suddenly ask about this?

16:04.920 --> 16:06.760
I'm not too sure either.

16:06.840 --> 16:07.760
I just heard

16:07.840 --> 16:09.760
Old Madam suddenly summoned
Ms. Jiang Li over

16:09.840 --> 16:11.960
and sold her maids.

16:12.040 --> 16:13.680
They said she'll send new maids to her.

16:15.360 --> 16:17.280
She's trying to keep me in check.

16:18.520 --> 16:19.480
But the Old Madam

16:19.560 --> 16:21.040
didn't pursue this matter.

16:21.120 --> 16:22.240
This means

16:22.320 --> 16:24.200
she doesn't want
to have a fallout with you.

16:24.280 --> 16:26.200
It was clearly Ruoyao's Hairpin Ceremony.

16:26.800 --> 16:28.880
Yet that girl stole the limelight.

16:29.440 --> 16:30.920
I even had to adorn her hair

16:31.000 --> 16:33.120
in front of everyone.

16:33.680 --> 16:34.720
Since it has come to this,

16:35.200 --> 16:37.040
I must fulfill my duties

16:37.120 --> 16:39.240
as a mother now.

16:39.320 --> 16:40.560
What do you have in mind, Madam Ji?

16:42.800 --> 16:44.440
Now that she has entered adulthood,

16:45.000 --> 16:46.320
I must plan

16:46.840 --> 16:48.840
her marriage properly

16:49.600 --> 16:50.480
to avoid

16:51.000 --> 16:52.880
being accused of ill-treatment.

17:03.920 --> 17:05.760
My lady, my name is Bai Xue.

17:05.839 --> 17:07.680
This is her background.

17:07.760 --> 17:08.800
My lady, please review it.

17:08.880 --> 17:10.040
If you're satisfied with her,

17:10.119 --> 17:11.520
you can keep her around.

17:13.520 --> 17:14.560
Thank you, Ms. Zhang.

17:19.960 --> 17:21.440
BAI XUE, BORN IN ZAOHUA VILLAGE

17:22.000 --> 17:23.920
My lady, I'm healthy and strong.

17:24.000 --> 17:25.640
I can clean the courtyard.

17:26.280 --> 17:28.000
It states here

17:28.600 --> 17:30.000
that you're from Zaohua Village.

17:34.800 --> 17:36.160
I know a girl

17:36.880 --> 17:38.120
who's also from Zaohua Village.

17:38.680 --> 17:40.040
What's her name?

17:40.120 --> 17:41.480
I may know her.

17:41.560 --> 17:42.400
Haitang.

17:43.520 --> 17:44.480
She's over 20 years old.

17:45.000 --> 17:46.200
She has two younger brothers.

17:47.120 --> 17:48.520
I've never heard of her before.

17:48.600 --> 17:52.160
But my parents have been living
in Zaohua Village for a long time.

17:52.240 --> 17:53.240
I can write home

17:53.320 --> 17:54.560
and ask around.

17:55.360 --> 17:56.520
Thank you.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.040
Miss.

18:05.120 --> 18:06.960
Why are you searching
for a girl named Haitang?

18:07.520 --> 18:09.960
Haitang was my maid.

18:11.320 --> 18:12.320
After that incident,

18:12.400 --> 18:13.440
I never saw her again.

18:14.000 --> 18:15.560
But her disappearance is fishy.

18:16.520 --> 18:17.880
Perhaps she knows something.

18:18.440 --> 18:19.440
I'm not sure

18:19.520 --> 18:20.840
if she was also harmed.

18:22.120 --> 18:23.120
If I can find her,

18:24.640 --> 18:28.000
it might reveal the truth
of what happened.

18:50.520 --> 18:51.480
Dear.

18:54.280 --> 18:55.440
Dear,

18:55.520 --> 18:56.440
you're back.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.360
Are you all right?

19:02.680 --> 19:03.520
Does it hurt?

19:04.360 --> 19:05.600
I'm fine.

19:05.680 --> 19:07.080
Next time, let the servants handle

19:07.160 --> 19:08.720
the needlework.

19:08.800 --> 19:11.760
All these years, I've always sewn

19:11.840 --> 19:13.400
all of your clothing myself.

19:14.840 --> 19:17.120
Everything in this house

19:17.200 --> 19:19.240
is handled with these hands.

19:21.320 --> 19:22.720
Dear, it must be hard for you.

19:23.280 --> 19:26.040
I just learned these things
after marriage.

19:26.120 --> 19:29.080
My parents never taught me
these things at home before.

19:29.560 --> 19:31.440
They only let me focus
on practicing guqin.

19:31.520 --> 19:32.440
That's right.

19:34.920 --> 19:36.440
When we first met,

19:37.800 --> 19:40.400
you played a song

19:40.960 --> 19:42.480
at your father's banquet.

19:43.120 --> 19:45.560
I still can't forget it.

19:46.400 --> 19:48.280
But now, these hands

19:48.840 --> 19:51.160
are worn out from the household's affairs.

19:52.640 --> 19:54.000
My little hardships

19:54.080 --> 19:55.680
are nothing compared to yours.

19:56.840 --> 19:58.360
You must be tired.

20:03.720 --> 20:04.560
Have some tea.

20:04.640 --> 20:05.480
All right.

20:06.600 --> 20:09.680
I've been unable
to manage Li'er's affairs properly.

20:10.160 --> 20:13.480
I feel ashamed as a mother.

20:14.960 --> 20:16.760
It's not entirely your fault.

20:16.840 --> 20:19.080
Although Li'er was
in the mountain for years,

20:19.160 --> 20:20.800
she's gentle and sensible.

20:20.880 --> 20:22.720
I want to find a good husband for her.

20:24.200 --> 20:26.760
I heard the Minister of Personnel's
youngest son

20:26.840 --> 20:27.840
is still not married.

20:27.920 --> 20:30.080
He has a good appearance and character.

20:30.760 --> 20:32.120
His family isn't that prestigious.

20:37.320 --> 20:39.560
Minister Zhao's rank is below yours.

20:40.120 --> 20:42.120
But he is loyal and steady,

20:42.880 --> 20:46.160
which is rare in officialdom.

20:46.720 --> 20:50.800
Zhao Qi is also good-looking
and well-educated.

20:50.880 --> 20:52.600
I'm sure he would treat Li'er well.

21:00.760 --> 21:02.440
Li'er was raised in Zhennv Hall

21:02.520 --> 21:04.320
without formal education.

21:04.400 --> 21:05.920
She had a questionable reputation too.

21:06.760 --> 21:09.600
With His Majesty's promotion
of female education,

21:10.520 --> 21:11.400
it's natural

21:11.480 --> 21:13.400
to want a well-educated daughter-in-law.

21:13.960 --> 21:16.440
Li'er is lacking in this aspect.

21:17.280 --> 21:19.280
If someone marries her

21:19.840 --> 21:21.040
just to gain favor with you

21:21.120 --> 21:23.360
but disdains and mistreats her,

21:23.440 --> 21:24.960
won't that be my fault?

21:27.360 --> 21:29.960
So after much consideration,

21:30.040 --> 21:31.560
I sought the Zhao family

21:31.640 --> 21:33.240
and asked for their opinion.

21:33.320 --> 21:35.000
They're very willing.

21:35.080 --> 21:37.680
Besides, Li'er has your support.

21:38.240 --> 21:41.000
She won't suffer after she marries.

21:41.960 --> 21:43.280
You're right.

21:44.120 --> 21:47.040
But we should also consider
Li'er's feelings.

21:59.240 --> 22:01.160
Why are you staring at me, Father?

22:04.320 --> 22:08.440
I think you're now an adult

22:10.640 --> 22:13.240
and it's time to consider marriage.

22:14.640 --> 22:16.120
I've only just returned.

22:17.080 --> 22:18.640
Are you already trying to send me away?

22:21.120 --> 22:22.720
Don't be ridiculous.

22:23.600 --> 22:25.480
We've just reunited

22:25.560 --> 22:26.960
and we're talking about separating.

22:28.520 --> 22:29.640
I feel upset.

22:31.840 --> 22:34.280
I'm not forcing you to marry now.

22:35.280 --> 22:37.440
We can meet him first.

22:37.520 --> 22:39.160
If it's a good match, let's agree on it,

22:39.760 --> 22:41.640
then we can discuss marriage later.

22:43.240 --> 22:46.560
Your mother has worked hard
on this for you.

22:49.600 --> 22:51.360
We can't let her down.

22:54.360 --> 22:55.200
All right.

22:56.640 --> 22:58.120
I'll do as you say.

23:03.040 --> 23:03.880
Miss,

23:03.960 --> 23:04.960
why is Ji Shuran

23:05.040 --> 23:06.880
suddenly introducing
a marriage prospect to you?

23:09.880 --> 23:12.880
I'm sure she wants to get rid of me,

23:12.960 --> 23:14.280
so she's eager to marry me off.

23:16.040 --> 23:17.400
Who is Zhao Qi?

23:18.320 --> 23:19.560
I did ask around.

23:19.640 --> 23:20.600
He's a talented scholar.

23:21.320 --> 23:23.240
Three years ago,
he performed exceptionally well

23:23.320 --> 23:24.680
at the Imperial Academy's examination,

23:24.760 --> 23:26.680
earning an audience with His Majesty
and rewards.

23:26.760 --> 23:28.360
However, he refused an official position.

23:30.840 --> 23:32.520
Why would Ji Shuran

23:32.600 --> 23:35.200
give me such a good match?

23:35.880 --> 23:37.960
Maybe if the match is not good enough,

23:38.040 --> 23:40.040
his lordship wouldn't agree so easily.

23:41.640 --> 23:42.920
There must be something fishy.

23:45.120 --> 23:47.080
How about you talk to his lordship

23:47.160 --> 23:48.040
and reject it?

23:49.040 --> 23:49.880
No.

23:50.640 --> 23:52.120
He already said

23:52.200 --> 23:54.440
Ji Shuran worked hard on this,
so we can't disappoint her.

23:55.080 --> 23:56.320
If I mention it again,

23:56.840 --> 23:58.320
I will be ungrateful.

24:01.880 --> 24:02.720
Miss,

24:02.800 --> 24:04.440
what if you talk to Old Madam?

24:04.520 --> 24:06.640
So what if she's rushing

24:07.400 --> 24:09.080
to find a good husband
for her stepdaughter?

24:09.600 --> 24:10.560
Is Ji Shuran wrong?

24:11.640 --> 24:13.480
- Well…
- If it's not a huge problem,

24:14.040 --> 24:16.160
Grandmother can't blame her.

24:18.080 --> 24:19.120
We must handle

24:20.960 --> 24:22.080
this matter ourselves.

24:23.960 --> 24:25.160
Chancellor Jiang.

24:27.520 --> 24:28.880
This is my son, Zhao Qi.

24:30.200 --> 24:31.360
Greetings, Chancellor Jiang.

24:32.040 --> 24:33.240
Greetings, Mrs. Jiang.

24:35.360 --> 24:38.880
Not bad. He looks quite dignified indeed.

24:39.520 --> 24:42.240
Ms. Jiang Li looks lovely.

24:42.320 --> 24:43.400
Greetings, Mrs. Zhao.

24:44.760 --> 24:46.360
These are some small gifts from us.

24:46.440 --> 24:47.920
Have a seat.

24:53.240 --> 24:54.240
Serve the tea.

24:55.480 --> 24:56.920
Our courtyards

24:57.400 --> 24:59.240
have some pleasant views.

24:59.960 --> 25:01.480
Mr. Zhao, it's your first time here.

25:02.080 --> 25:05.280
How about we let Li'er show you around?

25:07.840 --> 25:08.960
That'd be great.

25:13.920 --> 25:14.880
Ms. Jiang Li, after you.

25:21.280 --> 25:23.200
Finding a good husband for Jiang Li

25:23.280 --> 25:24.960
is the best solution to deal with her.

25:25.560 --> 25:27.440
Mr. Zhao made some trouble a few years ago

25:27.520 --> 25:30.000
and only got out of it
after working for my father.

25:31.000 --> 25:33.280
This gave my father
a hold over him for life.

25:33.360 --> 25:34.840
I hate Jiang Li.

25:35.320 --> 25:36.640
Without us getting involved,

25:37.240 --> 25:38.280
she'll never be able

25:39.320 --> 25:42.080
to turn the tables in this lifetime.

25:43.880 --> 25:44.720
Ms. Jiang Li,

25:45.240 --> 25:46.240
I've prepared a small gift

25:46.320 --> 25:47.520
for our first meeting.

25:54.440 --> 25:55.280
Is this blush?

25:55.760 --> 25:56.600
Yes.

25:57.080 --> 25:59.080
It is made from purple jasmine,

25:59.640 --> 26:01.440
giving it a hint of cold purple color.

26:01.520 --> 26:02.640
It's delicate yet elegant.

26:03.240 --> 26:05.240
It's not suitable for ordinary women

26:05.320 --> 26:06.840
but just right for you.

26:07.400 --> 26:09.000
Mr. Zhao, you're so thoughtful.

26:09.640 --> 26:11.800
But I did not prepare anything for you.

26:11.880 --> 26:12.720
It's all right.

26:13.240 --> 26:14.520
Let's end the pleasantries here.

26:14.600 --> 26:16.240
After living in Zhennv Hall for ten years,

26:16.320 --> 26:18.120
you returned in a grand fashion.

26:18.200 --> 26:20.120
You must be a smart person.

26:21.040 --> 26:23.640
Shall we be frank?

26:24.240 --> 26:25.560
Mr. Zhao, you're straightforward.

26:25.640 --> 26:27.160
I don't like
beating around the bush either.

26:28.000 --> 26:29.200
Great.

26:29.280 --> 26:30.440
I'll drop my act now.

26:31.080 --> 26:32.840
Listen.

26:32.920 --> 26:33.920
My parents

26:34.000 --> 26:36.280
hope for a prosperous family line.

26:36.360 --> 26:38.800
So after we're married, I hope

26:38.880 --> 26:40.720
your top priority is growing the family.

26:43.920 --> 26:45.840
Mr. Zhao, you sure are frank
and straightforward.

26:46.320 --> 26:47.920
But it's too early to discuss this.

26:49.840 --> 26:51.000
Here's the thing.

26:51.080 --> 26:53.440
I'll skip the romantic words,

26:53.520 --> 26:55.320
so you don't have to put up a pretense,

26:55.400 --> 26:56.840
then play hard to get later.

26:56.920 --> 26:59.600
You still have to marry me after going
back and forth that way, right?

27:00.160 --> 27:02.360
So it never occurred to you
that I'd reject you?

27:06.320 --> 27:07.480
You dare to refuse a marriage?

27:07.560 --> 27:08.400
Can't I?

27:08.880 --> 27:10.160
What a joke.

27:10.240 --> 27:11.800
Besides me, who else can you marry?

27:14.360 --> 27:16.040
Since ancient times,

27:16.120 --> 27:18.240
marriage arrangements
have always been about status.

27:18.840 --> 27:21.480
I'm the legitimate daughter
of the Jiang family

27:21.560 --> 27:23.840
and your father's rank
is lower than my father's.

27:23.920 --> 27:25.920
How high can your status be?

27:26.000 --> 27:26.960
Must I marry you?

27:27.040 --> 27:28.720
Do you really think

27:28.800 --> 27:30.520
your status as a legitimate daughter

27:30.600 --> 27:31.680
allows you

27:31.760 --> 27:32.960
to pick any man in this world?

27:33.040 --> 27:35.200
You probably don't know

27:35.280 --> 27:36.320
how the other elites

27:36.880 --> 27:38.480
in the city view you.

27:38.560 --> 27:41.040
Then please enlighten me.

27:41.120 --> 27:44.120
Then I shall reluctantly

27:44.200 --> 27:45.360
explain it to you.

27:48.760 --> 27:50.240
In noble family marriage unions,

27:50.320 --> 27:52.920
reputation is the most important thing.

27:53.520 --> 27:55.680
Then appearance and talent come after.

27:55.760 --> 27:57.680
A lady's virtue is important.

27:58.560 --> 27:59.920
How's yours?

28:04.080 --> 28:05.440
Your clothing style

28:05.520 --> 28:06.520
is extremely tacky.

28:07.520 --> 28:08.720
As for your appearance,

28:10.440 --> 28:11.920
it's quite unique,

28:12.000 --> 28:13.800
lacking proper care,
showing signs of fatigue.

28:14.280 --> 28:15.600
As for your talent,

28:16.160 --> 28:18.080
you stayed in the mountain for ten years

28:18.160 --> 28:19.760
without proper education.

28:19.840 --> 28:22.560
So how many words can you even read?

28:23.120 --> 28:24.200
As for your reputation,

28:24.760 --> 28:27.160
everyone knows
about the matricide and fratricide.

28:27.720 --> 28:29.280
If you were from an ordinary family,

28:29.360 --> 28:31.080
you'd marry just anyone.

28:31.160 --> 28:33.760
But as the Jiang family's
legitimate daughter,

28:33.840 --> 28:35.000
you could marry

28:35.080 --> 28:36.800
some lower-class illegitimate sons

28:36.880 --> 28:37.920
or be a concubine.

28:38.000 --> 28:40.000
But even if you were willing,

28:40.080 --> 28:41.800
would your family agree to that?

28:42.760 --> 28:43.960
In the capital,

28:44.040 --> 28:45.760
officials above the fifth rank

28:45.840 --> 28:47.240
won't accept you.

28:47.320 --> 28:48.480
And your family won't accept

28:48.560 --> 28:50.080
those below the fifth rank.

28:50.640 --> 28:51.480
That's why

28:51.560 --> 28:53.880
you need to thank the heavens

28:55.000 --> 28:57.360
that the Zhao family agreed
to this arrangement today.

28:57.440 --> 29:00.200
So are you the only one I can marry then?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.400
Do you have any other choice?

29:01.480 --> 29:03.960
Considering your nobility,

29:04.040 --> 29:06.280
why would you want
to marry someone like me?

29:06.360 --> 29:08.560
To grow the family.

29:13.760 --> 29:15.840
I guess you're not young anymore.

29:18.160 --> 29:21.120
Men don't age as gracefully as women.

29:22.000 --> 29:24.080
I can see the lines around your eyes.

29:24.160 --> 29:25.160
Really?

29:28.080 --> 29:29.040
Wait.

29:29.120 --> 29:30.760
Just tell me what you want to say.

29:30.840 --> 29:33.760
There can only be one possibility
for a fine man like you in the capital

29:33.840 --> 29:36.240
to be unmarried at your age

29:36.320 --> 29:38.400
and just focused

29:39.000 --> 29:40.160
on pleasing your parents.

29:43.600 --> 29:44.760
What is it?

29:44.840 --> 29:47.080
You have a lover but can't marry her.

29:49.280 --> 29:53.120
I never expected you to be such a joker.

29:54.040 --> 29:54.960
Have a grape.

29:55.600 --> 29:56.440
What's the matter?

29:57.120 --> 29:59.400
Does she not meet
the standards of the Zhao family?

29:59.480 --> 30:01.040
Which brothel is she from?

30:02.200 --> 30:03.040
You…

30:03.760 --> 30:04.880
What are you talking about?

30:05.600 --> 30:07.480
Others may not understand, but I do.

30:09.600 --> 30:10.680
When you were young,

30:10.760 --> 30:12.920
you saw how beautiful the lady
from the brothel was,

30:13.000 --> 30:14.560
so you kept her outside your home

30:14.640 --> 30:17.560
and played the role of a husband.

30:17.640 --> 30:19.760
You clearly like her
but don't dare to bring her home

30:20.320 --> 30:22.240
for fear of being scolded by your parents.

30:22.320 --> 30:23.760
You didn't fuss over getting married.

30:24.640 --> 30:26.800
Fortunately, you're still young,

30:26.880 --> 30:29.160
so you have ample excuses
to drag your marriage.

30:29.760 --> 30:31.800
Now that you're older,

30:31.880 --> 30:33.720
how can your parents
tolerate this anymore?

30:34.400 --> 30:36.320
You can't delay it

30:36.840 --> 30:39.000
and are afraid
of exposing your secret lover.

30:40.360 --> 30:42.200
So you must quickly find

30:42.280 --> 30:45.160
a suitable match
from a respectable family.

30:45.240 --> 30:46.120
However,

30:46.880 --> 30:48.800
those suitable matches look down on you

30:49.520 --> 30:52.880
because you're old.

30:53.560 --> 30:55.480
You can't aim for prestigious families

30:55.560 --> 30:58.200
and your parents won't accept
those with low standards.

30:58.280 --> 30:59.440
So you set your eyes on me,

30:59.520 --> 31:02.040
a notorious legitimate daughter
from a renowned family.

31:02.120 --> 31:05.920
So you're begging me to be kind,

31:06.000 --> 31:08.400
self-sacrificing, and heroic

31:08.480 --> 31:10.360
to rescue you from dire situations.

31:10.440 --> 31:11.920
Such baseless statements, nonsense,

31:12.000 --> 31:13.240
fabrication, and hogwash.

31:13.880 --> 31:16.120
Mr. Zhao, you're an unparalleled talent,

31:16.200 --> 31:18.040
well-learned,
with remarkable literary talent.

31:18.120 --> 31:19.800
- You…
- What?

31:20.360 --> 31:21.520
Zhao Qi,

31:21.600 --> 31:22.760
let me be clear.

31:22.840 --> 31:24.440
I won't marry you.

31:24.520 --> 31:26.760
First, I'm discerning

31:26.840 --> 31:28.320
and won't turn a blind eye.

31:28.400 --> 31:30.760
Second, I have other matters to attend to.

31:30.840 --> 31:31.840
I can't marry anyone.

31:31.920 --> 31:33.880
Go and reject this marriage.

31:34.440 --> 31:36.000
Otherwise, when I'm in a bad mood,

31:36.080 --> 31:39.040
I'll bring my family to your secret lover
and send her to your Zhao family.

31:39.120 --> 31:40.760
At this moment,

31:40.840 --> 31:43.560
are you threatening me?

31:43.640 --> 31:45.560
It's not a threat.

31:45.640 --> 31:47.240
I'm just ending our marriage arrangement.

31:48.240 --> 31:51.320
What I'll say next is a threat.

31:52.640 --> 31:53.960
Zhao Qi,

31:54.040 --> 31:55.520
listen to me clearly.

31:56.320 --> 31:58.720
You can toy with a lady without support.

31:58.800 --> 32:02.240
But marrying a lady from a noble family
just to continue your family line

32:02.320 --> 32:03.640
is unheard of.

32:04.360 --> 32:06.200
I'll let your behavior slide today.

32:06.280 --> 32:07.920
But if I ever find out

32:08.000 --> 32:10.720
you treat other ladies like this.

32:10.800 --> 32:12.120
I'll expose everything

32:12.600 --> 32:15.120
and the Zhao family
will be humiliated in the capital.

32:17.680 --> 32:18.840
Go.

32:19.640 --> 32:22.640
If we keep talking,
you'll reveal your true colors

32:23.280 --> 32:24.640
and it'll be an eyesore.

32:28.560 --> 32:31.000
I do proper care daily.

32:38.480 --> 32:40.640
These two have been away
for quite a while.

32:40.720 --> 32:42.240
They must be getting along well.

32:46.160 --> 32:48.920
Mr. Zhao doesn't seem
to be interested in me.

32:49.000 --> 32:50.200
What?

32:55.920 --> 32:56.920
Yes, Mother.

32:59.760 --> 33:02.320
Let's discuss this marriage matter again.

33:17.440 --> 33:19.040
Miss, you're so clever.

33:19.760 --> 33:21.640
How did you know he had a lover?

33:23.320 --> 33:24.840
I had a friend

33:24.920 --> 33:27.280
who went through this kind of ordeal.

33:27.360 --> 33:28.680
Ever since we had Ping'an,

33:28.760 --> 33:30.560
he hasn't touched me.

33:31.480 --> 33:34.120
He spends his time with his lover outside,
drinking and having fun.

33:34.720 --> 33:35.760
DAI YUN

33:35.840 --> 33:36.760
Ms. Xue.

33:37.600 --> 33:39.960
Sorry to tell you about these things.

33:41.560 --> 33:43.440
What's your plan after this?

33:44.160 --> 33:46.000
Now that I have Ping'an

33:46.080 --> 33:47.360
and his family has a descendant,

33:47.920 --> 33:50.960
his parents can't meddle
no matter how much he's having fun.

33:51.880 --> 33:53.800
This is how my life would be forever.

33:53.880 --> 33:54.960
As for you,

33:55.480 --> 33:58.000
you must keep this in mind.

33:59.560 --> 34:02.080
Those who just want women

34:02.560 --> 34:04.240
to continue their family line

34:04.320 --> 34:05.400
are shameless.

34:06.280 --> 34:09.159
Women are doomed for one wrong decision,

34:09.239 --> 34:11.639
but men can be philanderers

34:11.719 --> 34:14.239
and their families would even go
to great lengths to cover it up.

34:14.320 --> 34:15.520
How despicable.

34:16.080 --> 34:17.679
But Ji Shuran is determined

34:17.760 --> 34:19.199
to kick you out of the family now.

34:19.760 --> 34:23.159
Besides, marriages are decided by parents
and arranged by matchmakers.

34:23.719 --> 34:25.360
You managed to get rid of Mr. Zhao today.

34:25.440 --> 34:27.320
There will be other prospects after this.

34:28.239 --> 34:29.600
What should we do then?

34:32.880 --> 34:34.760
To stay in the Jiang Residence,

34:34.840 --> 34:36.400
I need to find another way.

34:37.320 --> 34:38.159
What way?

34:43.360 --> 34:44.239
Walk out of here.

34:51.560 --> 34:53.520
YANG RESIDENCE

35:00.920 --> 35:02.080
What's the meaning of this?

35:02.160 --> 35:03.960
Yang Song is suspected
of colluding with merchants

35:04.040 --> 35:04.960
to secretly sell official salt.

35:05.040 --> 35:06.440
We're ordered to arrest him.

35:06.520 --> 35:07.880
We have female family members here.

35:07.960 --> 35:10.280
Even secret guards
cannot barge in like this.

35:10.360 --> 35:11.200
Mrs. Yang,

35:11.840 --> 35:13.200
since there are women in the house,

35:13.280 --> 35:14.320
we won't search inside.

35:15.120 --> 35:16.680
Please ask him to come out.

35:17.720 --> 35:18.720
Duke Su,

35:18.800 --> 35:20.280
there must be a mistake.

35:20.360 --> 35:21.560
My husband would never commit

35:21.640 --> 35:22.760
such a crime.

35:22.840 --> 35:24.600
He has been honest
and upright all his life.

35:24.680 --> 35:26.280
He never accepted any gifts.

35:26.360 --> 35:27.240
But he gave away

35:27.320 --> 35:28.800
a lot of things from this household.

35:28.880 --> 35:31.040
How could such a person break the law?

35:31.120 --> 35:32.360
Mrs. Yang, have a seat.

35:32.440 --> 35:33.760
Please have a seat, Mrs. Yang.

35:40.240 --> 35:41.920
I believe you are unaware of this matter.

35:42.560 --> 35:44.080
I've investigated many cases like this.

35:44.160 --> 35:46.240
Even the Ministry of Justice
sentenced him in the end,

35:46.320 --> 35:48.760
but his wife and kid were still crying
about his innocence.

35:49.520 --> 35:50.640
They were unaware

35:50.720 --> 35:51.920
that their actions

35:52.000 --> 35:54.120
wasted His Majesty's mercy.

35:54.200 --> 35:55.400
Once His Majesty was enraged,

35:55.480 --> 35:56.520
the family wasn't spared.

35:57.000 --> 35:58.960
Do you know

35:59.040 --> 36:00.160
where these people ended up?

36:01.040 --> 36:02.120
They were enslaved

36:02.200 --> 36:04.160
and confined at the Office of Instruction.

36:04.240 --> 36:07.920
Until death, they had no idea
who failed them.

36:08.880 --> 36:10.160
Forget the wife.

36:10.680 --> 36:13.400
Even the pitiful young children
became slaves

36:14.160 --> 36:15.280
with no future at all.

36:19.080 --> 36:20.240
Where is Yang Song?

36:46.320 --> 36:47.760
A confession letter?

36:48.720 --> 36:49.560
We've been tricked.

36:54.680 --> 36:55.640
Your Majesty,

36:55.720 --> 36:57.920
the Bureau of Salt and Iron
had such a corrupt official.

36:58.000 --> 36:59.360
I have failed in my duty.

36:59.880 --> 37:01.640
I'm willing to be punished.

37:01.720 --> 37:03.160
But before that,

37:03.240 --> 37:04.560
I ask

37:04.640 --> 37:06.240
for a chance to rectify the situation.

37:06.840 --> 37:08.960
I'll punish the people
in the Bureau of Salt and Iron.

37:09.040 --> 37:11.720
I'm truly grateful to Duke Su for finding

37:11.800 --> 37:13.920
corrupt officials
in the Bureau of Salt and Iron.

37:14.000 --> 37:16.040
You don't need to praise me, Judge Kong.

37:16.560 --> 37:18.000
I put in so much effort.

37:18.080 --> 37:20.120
Yet I only caught
this small corrupt official for you.

37:20.200 --> 37:21.800
Such is my incompetence.

37:21.880 --> 37:23.000
How about I

37:23.080 --> 37:24.240
take the punishment for this?

37:24.800 --> 37:27.200
Duke Su deserves credit
for the salt trafficking case.

37:27.280 --> 37:28.560
As for the Bureau of Salt and Iron,

37:28.640 --> 37:30.120
corruption has been deep-rooted.

37:30.200 --> 37:31.520
It can't be purged overnight.

37:31.600 --> 37:33.960
But take this as a warning, Minister Kong.

37:34.560 --> 37:35.760
Be extremely cautious.

37:36.440 --> 37:38.880
I won't disappoint Your Majesty's trust.

37:39.880 --> 37:41.080
You're dismissed.

37:41.160 --> 37:42.600
- Minister Shen.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

37:43.360 --> 37:46.320
How is the progress
on the Imperial Examination reform?

37:46.400 --> 37:47.400
Your Majesty,

37:47.480 --> 37:48.680
I have started abolishing

37:48.760 --> 37:51.280
the pre-submission of literary samples
and public recommendations.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.560
The exam will determine the ranking.

37:52.640 --> 37:54.000
The new anonymous grading system

37:54.080 --> 37:55.680
has also been implemented
in the recent Provincial Examination.

37:55.760 --> 37:57.000
For next year's Imperial Examination,

37:57.080 --> 37:59.080
all examination halls will implement
the new system.

37:59.160 --> 38:01.800
Other than that, post stations
have been set up in some counties

38:01.880 --> 38:04.360
near the capital to issue vouchers
and provide subsidies

38:04.440 --> 38:06.760
to underprivileged examinees
heading to the capital for exams.

38:06.840 --> 38:08.480
After implementing this policy,

38:08.560 --> 38:10.240
it has raised the people's spirits.

38:10.320 --> 38:12.160
The number of examinees
is increasing daily.

38:12.240 --> 38:13.280
Your Majesty,

38:13.360 --> 38:16.080
it's commendable to give
underprivileged scholars opportunities.

38:16.160 --> 38:18.800
However, adding new rules
and canceling literary work pre-submission

38:18.880 --> 38:20.360
increases the burden on examiners.

38:20.440 --> 38:23.960
I've heard some cases of misjudgment
in the Provincial Examination

38:24.040 --> 38:25.680
and examinees reported it
to the government office.

38:25.760 --> 38:28.280
The capital's post stations
also experienced chaos and overcrowding.

38:28.880 --> 38:30.840
The Imperial Examination
is held every three years.

38:30.920 --> 38:32.680
Just relying on a single exam

38:32.760 --> 38:34.880
can lead to talented individuals failing

38:34.960 --> 38:36.840
and mediocre ones being selected.

38:36.920 --> 38:40.160
If the chief examiner could know
some genuinely talented candidates

38:40.240 --> 38:41.920
through the pre-submission
of literary work,

38:42.000 --> 38:43.520
they would be better informed.

38:43.600 --> 38:44.880
Hastily abolishing this system

38:44.960 --> 38:47.200
could compromise fairness too.

38:47.280 --> 38:48.920
Better informed?

38:49.560 --> 38:51.600
Is it better informed
about the examinees' talents

38:51.680 --> 38:54.000
or their family backgrounds?

38:55.760 --> 38:56.880
Your Majesty,

38:56.960 --> 38:58.040
I believe

38:58.120 --> 39:00.000
that since pre-submitted literary work

39:00.080 --> 39:02.320
can lead to collusion
between examinees and examiners,

39:02.400 --> 39:03.640
abolishing it is the right move.

39:04.240 --> 39:06.480
As for Chancellor Li's concerns,

39:06.560 --> 39:10.040
the issue lies not in the new system
but in the academic administration.

39:10.680 --> 39:14.480
Appointing competent officials
to enhance academic administration

39:14.560 --> 39:17.640
to support the new exams is the way
to address the fundamental problems.

39:25.160 --> 39:26.840
A new system will inevitably

39:26.920 --> 39:28.320
have some shortcomings at first.

39:28.400 --> 39:29.840
We can just address them one by one.

39:30.440 --> 39:31.600
If we cling to old practices

39:31.680 --> 39:33.400
because we encounter constraints,

39:33.480 --> 39:35.000
then reforms throughout history

39:35.080 --> 39:36.320
would never have succeeded.

39:36.400 --> 39:37.240
Minister Shen,

39:38.240 --> 39:39.960
you can proceed without hesitation.

39:41.040 --> 39:42.120
Thank you, Your Majesty.

39:42.960 --> 39:44.440
Speaking of the Imperial Examination,

39:45.000 --> 39:46.960
let's discuss the Central Six Academies.

39:47.520 --> 39:49.720
The Imperial Academy's Annual Exam
on six subjects

39:49.800 --> 39:51.400
has produced talents like Zhao Qi,

39:51.480 --> 39:53.280
who's not interested
in becoming an official.

39:53.360 --> 39:54.680
The School of Integrity,

39:54.760 --> 39:56.800
initially established
to promote female education,

39:56.880 --> 39:59.480
has been overlooked in recent years.

39:59.560 --> 40:01.360
I want you to oversee

40:01.440 --> 40:03.360
this year's Annual Exams for both schools.

40:04.120 --> 40:05.520
Keep an eye

40:06.120 --> 40:07.960
on those with genuine talent

40:08.040 --> 40:10.000
and high aspirations for me.

40:10.640 --> 40:12.320
Yes, Your Majesty.

40:15.080 --> 40:15.920
Yes, Your Majesty.

40:20.520 --> 40:21.840
Trinkets for sale!

40:22.480 --> 40:25.080
My lord, we should let
that cunning Kong Zhaofeng

40:25.160 --> 40:26.920
lose some skin on our interrogation bench.

40:28.000 --> 40:30.080
He has been in charge
of the Bureau of Salt and Iron

40:30.160 --> 40:32.240
for so many years
because of his clean reputation.

40:33.440 --> 40:34.560
We can't touch him yet.

40:34.640 --> 40:37.880
Are we going to watch him
have his fingers in the till

40:37.960 --> 40:39.360
and let Yang Song take the fall?

40:39.440 --> 40:41.760
Yang Song was just a pawn.

40:44.600 --> 40:46.840
Have a taste of our fine wine!

40:50.440 --> 40:51.360
This is

40:53.160 --> 40:55.000
the finest tea of the year.

40:55.080 --> 40:56.760
Judge Kong, have a cup.

41:04.720 --> 41:06.320
Tea can be refilled once spilled.

41:07.520 --> 41:09.600
But if someone gets a hold
of your weaknesses,

41:10.320 --> 41:12.000
it will be hard to break free.

41:12.080 --> 41:13.680
I was careless.

41:13.760 --> 41:15.000
But don't worry.

41:15.080 --> 41:17.920
I've cleaned up
the Bureau of Salt and Iron thoroughly.

41:18.000 --> 41:19.800
Su Heng won't find anything.

41:20.760 --> 41:21.920
I hope so.

41:36.240 --> 41:37.360
- Father.
- Father.

41:38.680 --> 41:40.760
Do you know why I asked you to come here?

41:43.800 --> 41:45.640
Money from the Bureau of Salt and Iron
is cut off

41:46.200 --> 41:47.920
while that side needs money.

41:48.440 --> 41:51.400
We need to fill this gap.

41:51.480 --> 41:52.640
Where should we start?

41:52.720 --> 41:53.880
- The Ye family.
- Ye family.

41:53.960 --> 41:55.600
The Ye and Jiang families

41:56.440 --> 41:58.040
are in-laws.

41:58.120 --> 41:59.600
Since Jiang Yuanbai remarried

42:00.120 --> 42:01.560
and Ye Zhenzhen's daughter Jiang Li

42:02.040 --> 42:03.160
was sent to the Zhennv Hall,

42:03.240 --> 42:05.360
the Ye and Jiang families

42:05.880 --> 42:07.640
have not been in contact since.

42:07.720 --> 42:09.360
The Ye family may be wealthy,

42:09.440 --> 42:10.800
but they lack prestige.

42:11.520 --> 42:13.520
The other year,
the Ye family did everything

42:13.600 --> 42:16.280
so their son Ye Shijie would get
a provincial office recommendation

42:16.360 --> 42:17.680
to study with us

42:17.760 --> 42:19.040
at the Imperial Academy.

42:19.520 --> 42:20.640
If we can control him,

42:20.720 --> 42:22.600
won't we be able to control
the entire Ye family?

42:22.680 --> 42:25.560
Since you've thought of this,
why didn't you take action?

42:26.120 --> 42:27.360
Ye Shijie is an arrogant loner.

42:28.000 --> 42:30.080
We haven't found
the right opportunity yet.

42:35.680 --> 42:37.800
I'll pave the way for you.

42:39.360 --> 42:40.240
- All right.
- All right.

42:52.880 --> 42:55.040
Why aren't you drinking, Yurong?

42:57.640 --> 42:58.800
A toast to you, Your Highness.

42:59.360 --> 43:02.360
Even your posture while holding
the wine cup looks graceful.

43:03.240 --> 43:04.360
There's no need for a toast.

43:05.200 --> 43:07.680
Today's banquet is for you.

43:08.240 --> 43:10.440
I heard His Majesty wanted you to oversee

43:10.520 --> 43:12.800
the Imperial Academy
and School of Integrity's Annual Exams.

43:13.320 --> 43:15.320
You're truly a talented individual.

43:17.360 --> 43:18.360
Thank you, Your Highness.

43:27.200 --> 43:29.680
Talented people in our nation
study in both schools.

43:29.760 --> 43:32.480
I'll work hard to select talents
for His Majesty.

43:33.040 --> 43:36.040
If it were just a routine examination,
it wouldn't be interesting.

43:36.600 --> 43:38.360
How about a joint competition

43:38.440 --> 43:40.760
where the Imperial Academy's gentlemen
can freely team up

43:40.840 --> 43:44.160
with ladies from the School of Integrity?

43:44.240 --> 43:46.000
That would be so lively.

43:46.080 --> 43:48.160
The mere thought of it is so exciting.

43:48.240 --> 43:49.080
We can't do that.

43:49.160 --> 43:51.680
After all, the Annual Exam
should be taken seriously.

43:52.280 --> 43:54.640
Why can't we try something innovative?

43:55.280 --> 43:56.840
If we follow Your Highness's suggestion,

43:56.920 --> 43:58.880
students may inevitably form cliques,

43:58.960 --> 44:01.600
then become narrowly partisan
and seek personal gains.

44:01.680 --> 44:03.600
Those with true talent

44:03.680 --> 44:04.680
but poor social skills

44:04.760 --> 44:06.680
or family background

44:06.760 --> 44:08.680
might be overlooked.

44:08.760 --> 44:11.360
This would be detrimental
to our government's integrity.

44:16.520 --> 44:19.960
You really are a clean
and honest young official.

44:23.240 --> 44:24.240
But I don't like it

44:24.320 --> 44:26.000
when you talk to me so seriously.

44:26.640 --> 44:27.840
It makes me uncomfortable.

44:27.920 --> 44:29.160
On your knees.

44:29.240 --> 44:30.520
Your Highness.

44:31.240 --> 44:32.120
Kneel.
